  "description": "The VIVI ACE01 Pro is a high-performance all-terrain fat electric bike that has passed both UL 2849 and UL 2271 safety certifications, offering excellent performance and reliable commuting capabilities. This e-bike features a robust 6061 aluminum alloy frame and 26x4.0-inch puncture-resistant wide tires, making it sturdy, durable, and safe. It is equipped with a 750W rear hub motor with a peak power of 1500W and a torque of 90Nm. Equipped with a responsive torque sensor for natural handling and a 48V 15Ah (720Wh) battery, it can reach a top speed of 25 mph and provide a range of up to 60 miles. This electric bike is equipped with high-quality hydraulic disc brakes for precise braking force, and also features a dedicated app connection to enable intelligent safety and control functions such as route tracking, GPS navigation, and anti-theft alarm.\n\nSmart App Control — Features include route tracking, GPS navigation, anti-theft alarms, and more.\n1500W Peak high speed brushless hub motor, 90Nm\nRemovable 48V 15Ah 720Wh semi-integrated battery\nNew upgraded torque sensor\n\nIntelligent 5 level pedal assist and digital LCD display\n\nSuspension fork with lockout and adjustment, 100mm travel\nHydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors\nShimano 7-speed gear system\n54.6V 3Amp smart fast charger\nTop 25Mph and Up to 60 miles of riding range (pedal assist)\n26 × 4.0\" all terrain fat tires\nSGS certified to UL2849 & UL2271 safety standards",
